# Do Not Touch

## Context

`app/src/store.ts` and `app/src/types.ts` are load-bearing core files (see
`materials/architecture-brief.md` for why).

## Rule

- Do NOT edit `app/src/store.ts` or the `Store`/`createStore` public shape in
  it, unless the user explicitly asks to change the store itself.
- Do NOT change existing fields/variants in `app/src/types.ts` — only ADD new
  `Action` union variants or new optional fields when a task requires it.
- Do NOT change the public signatures of existing action creators in
  `app/src/actions.ts` or existing functions in `app/src/lib/text.ts` — only
  add new ones.
- If a task seems to require editing a protected file's existing behavior,
  stop and ask the user first instead of proceeding.

## How to verify

1. `git diff app/src/store.ts` — empty unless the user explicitly requested a
   store change.
2. `git diff app/src/types.ts` — only shows added lines (new union members /
   new optional fields), no removed or altered existing lines.
3. Existing action-creator and `lib/text.ts` function signatures are unchanged
   (same params, same return types).
